#### 2. No Negative/Edge-Case Tests (systemic)

The entire suite only tests the happy path. Missing scenarios that are likely production bug sources:

| Missing test | Production risk |
|---|---|
| `UpdatePrice` with unknown SKU | `KeyNotFoundException` thrown — is this handled by callers? |
