| `Search` with no matches | Does it return empty list or null? |
| `ImportFromCsv` with malformed input | `IndexOutOfRangeException` / `FormatException` on bad data |
| `ApplyBulkDiscount` with fraction ≥ 1 | Prices go to zero or negative |
| `ExportToCsv` with empty catalog | Empty string? Header? |
| `GetProductCount` on empty catalog | Returns 0? |

